    {
      "voiceId": "chris-williamson",
      "voiceName": "Chris Williamson",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Huberman x McCusker x Segura. New studio, new format.\n\n3+ hour episode goes live next Monday \ud83d\ude80",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ChrisWillx/status/2056379199498150379",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-18T14:19:41+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "chris-williamson",
      "voiceName": "Chris Williamson",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "It\u2019s called The Wolverine Stack bro.\n\n\u201cPretty crazy how five years ago vaccines were the most devastating thing you could ever do to your body but nowadays its fine to inject Chinese peptides from Temu because you cant stop snacking after dinner\u201d \u2014 @abetrade",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ChrisWillx/status/2056016751578566892",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-17T14:19:27+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "chris-williamson",
      "voiceName": "Chris Williamson",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "No one cares, and that\u2019s amazing.\n\n\u201cNobody is coming to save you also implies that nobody is coming to stop you.\u201d",
      "sourceUrl": "https://x.com/ChrisWillx/status/2055734678972174848",
      "timestamp": "2026-05-16T19:38:35+00:00",
      "type": "tweet"
    },
    {
      "voiceId": "chris-williamson",
      "voiceName": "Chris Williamson",
      "platform": "x",
      "text": "Life is tough, your relationship shouldn\u2019t make it tougher.\n\n\u201cIf you have to work this hard to make it work, it isn\u2019t working.\u201d",
